WEBVTT

0
00:00:12.649 --> 00:00:15.119
Start by pulling sleeves above the wrist.

1
00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:27.809
Wet the forearm and hands with lukewarm water.

2
00:00:29.399 --> 00:00:34.099
Use a disposable fingernail cuticle cleaning pick to clean around the cuticles

3
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:38.000
and under the fingernails until there is no visible residue.

4
00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:44.799
Apply antibacterial soap

5
00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:48.740
and scrub hands and exposed forearms up to the elbow.

6
00:00:52.610 --> 00:00:54.150
Scrub between the fingers.

7
00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:06.739
Scrub the center of each palm in circular motion.

8
00:01:09.459 --> 00:01:12.480
Rinse the scrubbed areas with lukewarm water.

9
00:01:18.339 --> 00:01:20.800
Blot dry with a lint-free towel.

10
00:01:30.809 --> 00:01:31.919
If applicable,

11
00:01:32.099 --> 00:01:35.279
apply antiseptic before using any doors.